{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a super warrior who hates evil and comes to a city controlled by gangs. You will encounter the besieged mayor and embark on the path of upholding justice and eliminating evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat countless enemies, constantly explore, collect coins, purchase supplies and equipment, constantly become stronger, and become the hero of the entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 2D action fighting game that combines fun gameplay from other types of games such as <strong>Metroidvania , 2D Platformer Game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual combat resources: Energy and Rage, along with a wide variety of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accepts input buffering, making it easy for beginners to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No collision damage, automatic health regeneration, and a tough, resilient hero who's hard to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple abilities available from the start, ensuring a frustration-free experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mechanics: Combos, blocking, dodging, grabbing, throw techniques, and transformation.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Save the Mayor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334570/d80b6ca15298c2fb6e3a392795cc6051a5541451.jpg"},{"name":"Get rid of evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334570/53cf85ba36a632acfe2a32f1a8c941846286c722.jpg"},{"name":"Sharpshooter Jack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334570/6ddc67be932e46b8384d8fc8b779058412e12411.jpg"},{"name":"Adjudicator-I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334570/b24fa7f5a074e5aadd46e3d205fcb1d075194ad3.jpg"},{"name":"King Kong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/imag